2a:["$","article",null,{"className":"bg-card border border-border rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-12 shadow-xs prose dark:prose-invert max-w-none","children":[["$","h1","1",{"className":"text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-foreground mt-8 mb-4 tracking-tight","children":"The Complete 2026 World Rugby SVNS Guide"}],["$","p","3",{"className":"text-base sm:text-lg text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed my-4","children":"World Rugby's flagship annual competition, **HSBC SVNS**, features the top 12 men's and top 12 women's national teams competing across iconic global cities. Here is your definitive roadmap to the season."}],["$","h2","5",{"className":"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-foreground mt-8 mb-3 tracking-tight border-b border-border/50 pb-2","children":"How the SVNS Championship Format Works"}],["$","p","7",{"className":"text-base sm:text-lg text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed my-4","children":"The SVNS model emphasizes high-stakes drama from the opening kickoff in December through the Grand Final in June:"}],["$","p","9",{"className":"text-base sm:text-lg text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed my-4","children":"1. **Regular Season Stops**: Teams earn series standings points across 7 worldwide destination tournaments (Dubai, Cape Town, Perth, Vancouver, Hong Kong, Singapore, and Los Angeles)."}],["$","p","10",{"className":"text-base sm:text-lg text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed my-4","children":"2. **The Top Eight Cutoff**: Following the regular season, the top 8 teams in the standings qualify for the **Championship Grand Final**."}],["$","p","11",{"className":"text-base sm:text-lg text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed my-4","children":"3. **The Play-Off Drama**: Teams ranked 9th through 12th must compete in a relegation playoff tournament against the top four teams from the World Rugby Challenger Series."}],["$","h2","13",{"className":"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-foreground mt-8 mb-3 tracking-tight border-b border-border/50 pb-2","children":"Where to Watch USA Matches"}],["$","p","15",{"className":"text-base sm:text-lg text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed my-4","children":"In the United States, all SVNS matches are streamed live and on-demand via **Peacock**, with select weekend finals broadcast across **CNBC** and **NBC Sports**."}],["$","p","17",{"className":"text-base sm:text-lg text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed my-4","children":"International audiences can follow real-time match streams via **RugbyPass TV**."}]]}]
